# EyeVolt waveform example: mixed shapes across three channels.
#   CH0: triangle ramp 0 -> 3.3 V -> 0
#   CH1: square wave, 0 <-> 3.3 V every 512 steps
#   CH3: constant 1.65 V offset
# Channels 2, 4, 5, 6, 7 are inactive (hold manual value).

STEPS 2048

CH0  0@0  3300@1024  0@2047
CH1  0@0  0@511  3300@512  3300@1023  0@1024  0@1535  3300@1536  3300@2047
CH3  1650@0  1650@2047
